WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:04.604
- 'SUP, LADIES?
- WATCH THIS, WATCH THIS.

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:06.139
YO, TYRELL.

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:08.141
- YO, WHAT UP, LAWRENCE?

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:10.143
- HEY, MAN, YOU WANNA PLAY
FRONT HAND, BACK HAND?

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:12.211
- I DON'T KNOW THAT GAME, MAN.
- IT'S EASY, DOG.

00:00:12.244 --> 00:00:14.047
ALL YOU GOTTA DO IS SAY
"FRONT HAND" OR "BACK HAND."

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.181
- AIGHT, FRONT HAND.
- UGH!

00:00:15.214 --> 00:00:16.783
[all laughing]

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:19.519
BAM! I GOT YOU, SUCKA!

00:00:21.387 --> 00:00:23.089
- OH, OKAY.
OKAY.

00:00:23.122 --> 00:00:24.357
I SEE HOW IT IS NOW.

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:26.259
- COME ON, MAN.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:27.760
COME ON, YOU KNOW
THAT [bleep] WAS FUNNY.

00:00:27.793 --> 00:00:30.163
- BACK HAND.
- HUH?

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:33.132
- IT'S STILL MY MOVE, RIGHT?
I CHOOSE BACK HAND THIS TIME.

00:00:33.165 --> 00:00:34.300
- REALLY?

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:37.837
- BACK HAND, [bleep]!

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:40.773
- UH--

00:00:40.806 --> 00:00:43.409
all: OH!
[laughter]

00:00:43.442 --> 00:00:45.845
- GOD DAMN!

00:00:45.878 --> 00:00:48.081
- LOOK, TY, I'M SORRY.

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:49.182
BUT I AIN'T SORRY,
KNOW WHAT I MEAN?

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.184
I MEAN, YOU ASKED FOR IT.

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:52.385
I MEAN,
YOU LITERALLY ASKED FOR IT.

00:00:52.418 --> 00:00:54.320
- FRONT HAND!

00:00:54.353 --> 00:00:56.789
- WHAT? NO.
WHY YOU WANNA HIT--

00:00:56.822 --> 00:00:58.524
- I...GOT IT!
I FIGURED IT OUT.

00:00:58.557 --> 00:01:00.193
FRONT HAND!

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:01.494
NO, BACK HAND!
BACK HAND!

00:01:01.527 --> 00:01:03.629
- NO, LOOK, LOOK.

00:01:03.662 --> 00:01:05.164
DUDE, HEY, IF YOU WANT ME
TO SLAP YOU ACROSS THE FACE

00:01:05.197 --> 00:01:06.265
BACK HAND, I'LL DO IT, OKAY?

00:01:06.298 --> 00:01:08.267
DON'T THINK I WON'T DO IT.

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:10.470
BUT YOU KNOW THAT
I'M [bleep] WITH YOU, RIGHT?

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:10.670
I MEAN, THERE AIN'T NO GAME
CALLED "FRONT HAND, BACK HAND."

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:13.506
- OH!
- RIGHT. YEAH, YEAH.

00:01:13.539 --> 00:01:15.141
- OH, DOG!

00:01:15.174 --> 00:01:17.110
YEAH, I GET IT.
I GET IT.

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:19.145
ALL RIGHT,
ALL RIGHT, ALL RIGHT.

00:01:19.178 --> 00:01:21.447
AS SOON AS I GET GOOD
AT FRONT HAND, BACK HAND,

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:22.782
YOU WANNA STOP PLAYING.

00:01:22.815 --> 00:01:24.717
- PLAY WHAT, MAN?

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:27.120
I MADE IT UP SO I COULD
SMACK YOU IN THE FACE.

00:01:27.153 --> 00:01:29.222
- I'M ABOUT TO SMACK YOU
IN THE FACE

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:31.557
AS SOON AS IT'S MY TURN.
BACK HAND!

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:32.825
- THERE AIN'T NO TURNS,
[bleep],

00:01:32.858 --> 00:01:34.594
'CAUSE IT AIN'T NO GAME.

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:35.628
- YOU AIN'T GOT NO GAME,
[bleep].

00:01:35.661 --> 00:01:36.662
BACK HAND!

00:01:36.695 --> 00:01:39.165
AGHH!

00:01:48.307 --> 00:01:50.543
FRONT HAND.

00:01:50.576 --> 00:01:52.345
- LOOK, I DON'T KNOW
IF YOU'RE [bleep] WITH ME

00:01:52.378 --> 00:01:54.914
AT THIS POINT OR WHAT...

00:01:54.947 --> 00:01:59.652
BUT I DON'T WANNA...
SMACK A [bleep] NO MORE.

00:01:59.685 --> 00:02:02.221
- [exaggerated laughter]
WHERE YOU GOING THEN?

00:02:02.254 --> 00:02:04.323
OKAY, FORFEIT.

00:02:04.356 --> 00:02:08.261
FORFEIT, [bleep], I WIN!
I WIN FRONT HAND, BACK HAND!

00:02:08.294 --> 00:02:09.829
OKAY.
ME AND YOU.

00:02:09.862 --> 00:02:11.931
[bleep], ME AND YOU.
ME AND YOU.

00:02:11.964 --> 00:02:13.233
HMM?
BACK HAND.

00:02:17.736 --> 00:02:18.736
AH!

